{"type":"gu-agod-validity-check","status":"PASS","totals":{"cases":15,"revokedByIncompatibleContext":4,"revokedByContradiction":1,"staleAndRevalidated":1,"timeAloneRevokedAnything":0,"note":"time alone never revoked a verification in any case above"},"cases":[{"name":"a verification records what it was issued against","expectation":"ROM, core, detector and profile revision","observed":"{\"romHash\":\"rom-a\",\"coreRevision\":\"core-1\",\"detectorRevision\":\"det-1\",\"profileRevision\":\"prof-1\"}"},{"name":"fresh and in context","expectation":"VALID","observed":"VALID"},{"name":"detector revision changed","expectation":"REVOKED immediately, however fresh the verification is","observed":"REVOKED: detector revision changed: verified against det-1, now det-2"},{"name":"and it stays revoked","expectation":"REVOKED with its cause, not downgraded to NONE","observed":"REVOKED by incompatible-context"},{"name":"core revision changed","expectation":"REVOKED","observed":"REVOKED: core revision changed: verified against core-1, now core-2"},{"name":"another ROM","expectation":"REVOKED","observed":"REVOKED"},{"name":"profile revision changed","expectation":"REVOKED","observed":"REVOKED"},{"name":"older than the cache horizon","expectation":"STALE and revalidatable, not revoked","observed":"STALE, requiresRevalidation true, age 5000 ms"},{"name":"revalidating a stale verification","expectation":"moves the horizon only","observed":"revalidated true, state VALID, count 1"},{"name":"revalidating a revoked verification","expectation":"refused","observed":"revalidated false, state REVOKED - a REVOKED verification cannot be revalidated"},{"name":"contradiction","expectation":"REVOKED regardless of time, with the reason kept","observed":"REVOKED by contradiction: the game outcome disagreed with RAM"},{"name":"a goal that was never verified","expectation":"NONE, not REVOKED and not VALID","observed":"NONE"},{"name":"mutating an evidence record","expectation":"throws, and the stored record is unchanged","observed":"Cannot assign to read only property 'outcome' of object '#<Object>'; stored outcome still confirmed"},{"name":"mutating a record provenance list","expectation":"throws","observed":"Cannot add property 1, object is not extensible"},{"name":"a registry built without a detector revision","expectation":"still verifies, and a detector revision cannot revoke what was never recorded","observed":"verified true, status VALID"}]}
PASS: 15 cases. An incompatible ROM, core, detector or profile revision revokes a verification outright and the revocation keeps its cause; a contradiction does the same; time alone only makes a verification stale, and revalidation moves the horizon without repairing anything revoked. Evidence records refuse mutation.
